{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgGwtky2L5mCv9ZmSSG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9103\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 1. The Request\n- **Request ID**: DR-9103  \n- **Customer**: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)  \n- **Product**: NS-EDGE (NS-Edge Monitoring Package), SKU NS-EDGE  \n- **Requested Discount**: 22% of $85,000 list price  \n- **Request Date**: 2025-09-23  \n- **Requestor**: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example), Enterprise Account Executive  \n- **Basis**: Stated as \"Competitive\" — not relying on contract terms or pricing exception\n\n### 2. Customer\nCRM account CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) matches ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings).\n\n### 3. Product\nSKU NS-EDGE confirmed as NS-Edge Monitoring Package with list price $85,000.\n\n### 4. Active Contract\nMaster Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 is active on 2025-09-23 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31) and covers NS-EDGE among its three products.\n\n### 5. Pricing Exception\nPricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 exists for Acme but is **explicitly scoped to NS-500 only**:\n> \"Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller (NS-500) only\"\n\n**No pricing exception covers NS-EDGE.** The Master Supply Agreement section 3.2 confirms pricing eligibility is limited to NS-500: \"Customer is eligible for discounts of up to **15%** on the NS-500 Industrial Controller, as set out in the pricing exception attached as Schedule B.\"\n\n### 6. Policy in Effect\n**Northstar Pricing Policy 2025** (effective 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31):\n- Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including **15%**\n- Discounts greater than 15% require **VP Sales approval**\n\n### 7. Requestor's Authority\nSarah Chen holds the role of Enterprise Account Executive. Under Policy 2025, her approval limit is **15%**.  \nRequested discount of 22% **exceeds her authority**.\n\n### 8. Required Approver\nFor a discount >15%, Policy 2025 requires VP Sales approval.  \n**VP Sales**: Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\n\n### 9. Decision\n\n**Cannot Sarah Chen approve this unilaterally?** No.\n\nThe discount of 22% exceeds her authority ceiling of 15%. However, the discount does not exceed the customer's established eligibility—there is **no special pricing for NS-EDGE** (no exception applies), so this is evaluated as a standard competitive discount governed by policy limits. The discount is within VP Sales authority under the 2025 policy (VP Sales can approve discounts exceeding 15%).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9103\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-EDGE\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"22.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"standard\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"No pricing exception for NS-EDGE; request is competitive discount under standard pricing\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2025\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"15%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 scoped to NS-500 only—does not cover NS-EDGE\",\n    \"Request justified as Competitive, not relying on special terms\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2025: Enterprise Account Executives ≤15%; VP Sales >15%\",\n    \"Historical precedent: VP Sales approved 22% discounts in 2025 (DR-7008, DR-7012)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage"